MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 485d5921c3c3316468c06692dcaf7421, type: 3}
  m_Name: Monk_3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueHolder
  lines:
  - Speaker: 'Player:'
    lines: HHuh? Where Am I?
  - Speaker: 'Monk:'
    lines: A negative space!
  - Speaker: 'Player:'
    lines: ' Negative space??'
  - Speaker: 'Angry Monk:'
    lines: Don't Fucking repeat what I am saying!! Listen
  - Speaker: 'Monk:'
    lines: A Negative Space is a place that exists inside your mind.
  - Speaker: 'Monk:'
    lines: This Cave is a Physical Manifestation of that Space.
  - Speaker: 'Monk:'
    lines: 'When you lose control of your emotions, '
  - Speaker: 'Monk:'
    lines: The cave transports you to The Negative Space created by that Emotion
  - Speaker: 'Monk:'
    lines: This is the Physical Manifestation of you Krodh, your Anger.
  - Speaker: 'Player:'
    lines: So how do I get out?... By controlling my emotions?
  - Speaker: 'Monk:'
    lines: 'No, Once you are in a Negative Space that option is taken away from you '
  - Speaker: 'Monk:'
    lines: But there is a way...
  - Speaker: 'Monk:'
    lines: You have to collect the pieces of you scattered conscience..
  - Speaker: 'Monk:'
    lines: Within 1 Minute of entering Negative-Space
  - Speaker: 'Monk:'
    lines: Go you are running out of time
